{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Hordes of the Dead</i> is a third-person survival horror game where you\u2019ll explore devastated areas, search for a safe place, and face relentless hordes of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina, find resources, and survive slow but deadly zombies. They won\u2019t stop until they tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Tense and visceral third-person combat<br>\u25cf Cinematic bite and death animations<br>\u25cf A dark atmosphere  designed for maximum tension<br>\u25cf Mission and exploration system to progress through different areas<br>\u25cf Detailed gore and brutal encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apocalypse has no explanation. No one is coming to save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you find a safe place... or will you become part of the Horde?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/766500?t=1766127016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/766500?t=1766127016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766500/896c5df222e198430b149caa26819e7400392311/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766127016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766500/896c5df222e198430b149caa26819e7400392311/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766127016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Hordes of the Dead</i> is a third-person survival horror game where you\u2019ll explore devastated areas, search for a safe place, and face relentless hordes of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina, find resources, and survive slow but deadly zombies. They won\u2019t stop until t